WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.410
You can just tell from watching Donald Trump's
rallies this week that there's something new

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:06.410
going on.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:11.420
There is a sort of desperate anger, I would
call it, that wasn't really there before.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:16.880
And it culminated in humiliating fashion last
night with Donald Trump at a rally in Erie,

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:21.750
Pennsylvania, which started nearly 50 minutes
late for no particular reason.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.060
I covered part of it live.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:28.800
Donald Trump telling the audience he doesn't
even want to be there, but he's losing now

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.230
and he sort of has to be there.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.520
He doesn't want to, but he had to do it.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.149
Great way to get the audience on your side.

00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:35.149
Right.

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:36.149
Take a look.

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:38.820
Because, you know, before the plague came
in, I had it made.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.920
I wasn't coming to Erie.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.079
I mean, I have to be honest, there's no way
I was coming.

00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:45.079
I didn't have to.

00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:46.079
I would've called today.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.789
You know, if you have a chance.

00:00:47.789 --> 00:00:48.789
Get out.

00:00:48.789 --> 00:00:49.789
But we had this thing one.

00:00:49.789 --> 00:00:50.789
We were so far up.

00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:52.710
We had the greatest economy ever.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.010
Greatest jobs, greatest everything.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.410
And then we got hit with the plague.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.850
And I had to go back to work.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.659
Hello, Weary.

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:06.150
I wouldn't be here if I didn't have to because
I screwed up the Corona virus response.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.540
Imagine if Barack Obama had ever said that.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.030
Imagine if Joe Biden said that during this
election or if Hillary Clinton had said that

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.430
back in 2016.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:18.710
I really don't want to be here, but I had
to come here to this lame place because I'm

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:19.710
losing.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.690
And by the way, if you don't vote for me,
I will never come back.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:26.720
Which Donald Trump has been saying in Pennsylvania
and in North Carolina and in many other places.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:34.610
And by the way, this idea that Corona virus
had to hurt him, that inevitably the virus

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:35.610
hurt him.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.190
So now he has to campaign.

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:40.920
World leaders who did a good job with the
virus are cruising to reelection.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:47.930
Jacinda Ardern in New Zealand sailed to overwhelming
reelections and a bigger Labor majority than

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:52.630
I think New Zealand has ever seen because
she handled the Corona virus properly.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:57.270
As I've said before, if Trump had handled
the virus properly, Biden would have no shot

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:58.290
right now.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:00.840
So that's also completely wrong.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:04.640
Then maybe the most humiliating moment of
this rally.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.740
Donald Trump saying nobody wants him.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:07.740
Really?

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:08.780
I can't believe it.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.390
You'd better give me the credit.

00:02:11.390 --> 00:02:14.040
Damn it, I'll take what I've put what I've
gone through.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:17.780
The drug companies are spending a fortune
on fake ads.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.780
They don't want me.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:19.780
They don't want me.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.530
China doesn't want me.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:27.049
