00:02:37.739 --> 00:02:41.769
But I think there is something real here,
which is Donald Trump does see the polls and

00:02:41.769 --> 00:02:44.859
even though publicly he says he's winning,
he knows he might lose.

00:02:44.859 --> 00:02:49.440
He does realize that everything he's doing
is sinking him further and further.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.810
He does the first debate.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.139
The polls collapse.

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:56.719
He continues to crater in many important states.

00:02:56.719 --> 00:02:58.659
And I think Trump is cognizant of that.

00:02:58.659 --> 00:03:03.090
And that's why you're seeing this attitude
for four from Donald Trump.

